      "body": "Analysts have kept the price target for Aptus Value Housing Finance India steady at ₹220, citing only minor updates to assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E in their valuation work. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on May 6, 2026, to consider audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026 (company filing) Board to consider payment of an interim dividend for the 2025-26 financial year and set a record date for shareholders, if the dividend is approved (company filing) Board to consider raising funds through issuance of debt securities in one or more tranches via private placement, subject to shareholder approval and existing overall limits (company filing) Special or extraordinary shareho",
